After extracting this archive, you'll need to have the following files
present:

c:run
devs:serial.device
l:Disk-Validator
libs:icon.library
libs:info.library
libs:version.library

These are minimum files required from your workbench disk which are
necessary to run this BBS.  You don't need to have Arexx, ARP, or any
other libraries to run the Elite BBS.  You still have a powerful
Bulletin Board System which runs at 19200 with Zmodem transfers and
a fine message and email system.

If you want to set up and run the BBS quickly, you should do the following:

1) cd to the root directory of your hard drive or floppy disk.

2) ensure the files listed above are in the correct directories.

3) extract the archive: lharc x EliteBBS.lzh
   answer Y to create the necessary directories

4) run Elite_BBS

Nick Smith.
